    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n8317" root="حضر" body-key="H">
    
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">حَضَرِىٌّ</span></b>  <i>An inhabitant of a region, district,</i>
or <i>tract, of cities, towns,</i> or <i>villages, and of cultivated land;</i> (S, A, * Msb;) opposed to <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">بَدَوِىٌّ</span>.
(S, A.) [See also <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">حَضِرٌ</span>.]

